<p>Each time one of your foes bites the dust, you feel a surge of power, increasing your strength by 2 (stacking up to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 12, 18, 24, 30</acronym>) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p>